Again, the user asks a question in Slack the identity
AgentCore Identity identifies who you are.

00:16:40.156 --> 00:16:45.436
So it basically goes against your authorization
authentication provider and gets your tokens down.

00:16:46.116 --> 00:16:53.516
The policy is AgentCore Policy sets the Guardrails on what
