00:17:49.556 --> 00:17:53.276
how do we ensure that the response is reliable and trustworthy?

00:17:54.716 --> 00:17:56.676
There's something called the trust loop.

00:17:56.676 --> 00:18:00.196
The Claude model doesn't really just answer on the first pass.

00:18:00.356 --> 00:18:05.796
What it does is it basically reasons against the AI agents
